[[File:Spiritual ranger icon.png|left]]
'''Spiritual rangers''' are powerful [[Ranged]] [[Slayer monsters]] found in the [[God Wars Dungeon]]. There are five types of spiritual rangers: [[Saradomin]]ists, [[Zamorak]]ians, [[Bandos]]ians, [[Armadyl]]eans, and [[Zaros]]ians. Spiritual rangers require 63 [[Slayer]] to kill, and the [[Troll Stronghold]] quest must be partially complete to gain access to the God Wars Dungeon. [[Spiritual creatures]] cannot be given as a [[Slayer task]] if the player has not completed the [[Death Plateau]] quest.

As with all other [[spiritual creature]]s, their stats and combat capabilities vary.

The Zarosian variant can perform a unique attack, launching an arrow into the air that will fall down on the player's position when the attack was used. If not dodged, it will deal 35+ damage and disable overhead protection prayers for a few ticks.

Saradominist spiritual rangers can be safespotted at the ruins south-east of the entrance in the God Wars Dungeon by the L-shaped wall. They do not see over the obstacles and will not remain in aggro. Stand south of the terrain to safespot the one(s) to the north. They can lure you out of the safespot to chase when wandering.
[[File:Picture Guide - Spiritual Ranger Safespot in Godwars Dungeon.png|thumb|Safespot guide for inside [[God Wars Dungeon]]]]

